---
layout: base.njk
title: Forum
permalink: /forum/
description: "Lou Massett's posts on the SSPX, the schism, leaving high-control religion, and life after Traddyland."
---
<div class="wrap page-head"><p class="kicker">Forum</p><h1>Posts from Lou.</h1><p class="lede">Notes, questions, and replies from the conversation around the book, carried over from the old site and continuing here.</p></div>
<section class="band" style="padding-top:1.5rem">
  <div class="wrap">
  {%- if collections.posts.length %}
    <ul class="news">
    {%- for p in collections.posts %}
      <li><a href="{{ p.url }}">
        <span class="date">{{ p | iso | longDate }}</span>
        <span><h3>{{ p.data.title }}</h3><p>{{ p.data.lede or (p.templateContent | striptags | truncate(180)) }}</p><span class="src">Read →</span></span>
      </a></li>
    {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  {%- else %}
    <p class="lede">Posts are on their way.</p>
  {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>
